# Key Learnings

- Business workflow validation is as important as identifying software defects.
- Date range filters should always return complete and accurate historical records.
- ERP transaction history screens should support operational review and reconciliation.
- QR Code functionality should be validated across every printable ERP document.
- Cross-module testing helps verify data consistency throughout the ERP system.

